cross it off the list.

605
00:20:22,708 --> 00:20:23,958
-Can we, Dad?
-Of course we can.

606
00:20:24,083 --> 00:20:26,250
Uh, you know,
he's got a dance lesson.

607
00:20:26,375 --> 00:20:27,666
No, I don't.

608
00:20:27,791 --> 00:20:30,166
Hope no one's allergic to fun.

609
